[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Hello and welcome to Real Easy English,",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 3.531,
    "zh": "大家好,欢迎收听《Real Easy English》,",
    "zh_hant": "大家好,歡迎收聽《Real Easy English》,"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "the podcast where we have real conversations",
    "start": 3.471,
    "end": 7.012,
    "zh": "这是一档用简单英语进行真实对话的播客,",
    "zh_hant": "這是一檔用簡單英語進行真實對話的播客,"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "in easy English to help you learn.",
    "start": 6.692,
    "end": 9.213,
    "zh": "帮助大家学习英语。",
    "zh_hant": "幫助大家學習英語。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "I'm Beth.",
    "start": 9.433,
    "end": 10.373,
    "zh": "我是Beth。",
    "zh_hant": "我是Beth。"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "And I'm Neil.",
    "start": 10.153,
    "end": 11.374,
    "zh": "我是Neil。",
    "zh_hant": "我是Neil。"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "There is a video version of this podcast on our website,",
    "start": 11.214,
    "end": 15.435,
    "zh": "我们的网站上有这档播客的视频版本,",
    "zh_hant": "我們的網站上有這檔播客的影片版本,"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "where you can also find a worksheet and transcript to help you learn.",
    "start": 15.455,
    "end": 19.656,
    "zh": "你还可以在那里找到帮助学习的练习题和文字稿。",
    "zh_hant": "你還可以在那裡找到幫助學習的練習題和文字稿。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "It's at bbclearningenglish.com.",
    "start": 19.877,
    "end": 22.417,
    "zh": "网址是bbclearningenglish.com。",
    "zh_hant": "網址是bbclearningenglish.com。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "Hi, Neil, how are you?",
    "start": 29.24,
    "end": 30.86,
    "zh": "嗨,Neil,你好吗?",
    "zh_hant": "嗨,Neil,你好嗎?"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "I'm hungry.",
    "start": 30.9,
    "end": 31.981,
    "zh": "我饿了。",
    "zh_hant": "我餓了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "Me too.",
    "start": 31.881,
    "end": 33.881,
    "zh": "我也是。",
    "zh_hant": "我也是。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "I'm starving.",
    "start": 33.481,
    "end": 35.202,
    "zh": "我快饿死了。",
    "zh_hant": "我快餓死了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "Well, that's good, because we're talking",
    "start": 35.482,
    "end": 38.043,
    "zh": "太好了,因为我们今天",
    "zh_hant": "太好了,因為我們今天"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "about lunch today.",
    "start": 37.943,
    "end": 39.983,
    "zh": "要聊的话题就是午餐。",
    "zh_hant": "要聊的話題就是午餐。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "We're recording this just before lunch,",
    "start": 40.303,
    "end": 43.044,
    "zh": "我们是在午饭前录的这期节目,",
    "zh_hant": "我們是在午飯前錄的這期節目,"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "so it's no wonder that we're both very hungry.",
    "start": 42.644,
    "end": 46.365,
    "zh": "所以难怪我们俩都很饿。",
    "zh_hant": "所以難怪我們倆都很餓。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "You might be able to hear our tummies rumble",
    "start": 46.386,
    "end": 49.566,
    "zh": "你可能会听到我们肚子咕咕叫的声音,",
    "zh_hant": "你可能會聽到我們肚子咕咕叫的聲音,"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "because we're hungry.",
    "start": 49.887,
    "end": 51.227,
    "zh": "因为我们真的很饿。",
    "zh_hant": "因為我們真的很餓。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "OK.",
    "start": 52.428,
    "end": 53.068,
    "zh": "好的。",
    "zh_hant": "好的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "So, shall we begin?",
    "start": 52.928,
    "end": 54.508,
    "zh": "那我们开始吧?",
    "zh_hant": "那我們開始吧?"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "Yes.",
    "start": 54.368,
    "end": 55.088,
    "zh": "好。",
    "zh_hant": "好。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "Let's do it.",
    "start": 54.688,
    "end": 55.668,
    "zh": "我们开始吧。",
    "zh_hant": "我們開始吧。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "What have you got for lunch today?",
    "start": 55.608,
    "end": 57.829,
    "zh": "你今天午餐吃什么?",
    "zh_hant": "你今天午餐吃什麼?"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "for my lunch,",
    "start": 57.969,
    "end": 59.81,
    "zh": "我的午餐是",
    "zh_hant": "我的午餐是"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "I have chicken with potatoes and vegetables",
    "start": 59.41,
    "end": 65.972,
    "zh": "鸡肉配土豆和蔬菜,",
    "zh_hant": "雞肉配土豆和蔬菜,"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "in a harissa paste.",
    "start": 66.132,
    "end": 68.072,
    "zh": "还加了哈里萨辣酱。",
    "zh_hant": "還加了哈里薩辣醬。"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "Oh, that sounds really nice.",
    "start": 68.253,
    "end": 70.933,
    "zh": "哦,听起来真不错。",
    "zh_hant": "哦,聽起來真不錯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "Yeah, it's leftovers actually,",
    "start": 70.733,
    "end": 73.054,
    "zh": "是啊,其实是剩菜,",
    "zh_hant": "是啊,其實是剩菜,"
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "text": "which I have heated up and brought",
    "start": 72.874,
    "end": 75.695,
    "zh": "我把它热了一下,",
    "zh_hant": "我把它熱了一下,"
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "text": "in in a little flask.",
    "start": 75.335,
    "end": 77.616,
    "zh": "装在一个小饭盒里带来了。",
    "zh_hant": "裝在一個小飯盒裡帶來了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 30,
    "text": "What are leftovers ?",
    "start": 77.396,
    "end": 79.676,
    "zh": "'leftovers'(剩菜)是什么意思?",
    "zh_hant": "'leftovers'(剩菜)是什麼意思?"
  },
  {
    "index": 31,
    "text": "Good question.",
    "start": 79.276,
    "end": 80.276,
    "zh": "好问题。",
    "zh_hant": "好問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 32,
    "text": ".",
    "start": 79.876,
    "end": 80.717,
    "zh": "。",
    "zh_hant": "。"
  },
  {
    "index": 33,
    "text": "That's food from a meal",
    "start": 80.317,
    "end": 83.117,
    "zh": "就是你已经吃过的一餐",
    "zh_hant": "就是你已經吃過的一餐"
  },
  {
    "index": 34,
    "text": "that you've already had that you didn't finish,",
    "start": 82.717,
    "end": 85.618,
    "zh": "剩下没吃完的食物,",
    "zh_hant": "剩下沒吃完的食物,"
  },
  {
    "index": 35,
    "text": "and you can heat it up and eat it again.",
    "start": 85.518,
    "end": 88.319,
    "zh": "你可以把它加热,再吃一次。",
    "zh_hant": "你可以把它加熱,再吃一次。"
  },
  {
    "index": 36,
    "text": "Yes.",
    "start": 88.339,
    "end": 88.979,
    "zh": "对。",
    "zh_hant": "對。"
  },
  {
    "index": 37,
    "text": "I also have leftovers for my lunch today.",
    "start": 88.579,
    "end": 92.761,
    "zh": "我今天的午餐也是剩菜。",
    "zh_hant": "我今天的午餐也是剩菜。"
  },
  {
    "index": 38,
    "text": "So, yesterday I made a pasta for lunch",
    "start": 92.441,
    "end": 98.202,
    "zh": "昨天我做了意大利面当午餐,",
    "zh_hant": "昨天我做了義大利麵當午餐,"
  },
  {
    "index": 39,
    "text": "with vegetables in it",
    "start": 97.962,
    "end": 101.183,
    "zh": "里面加了蔬菜,",
    "zh_hant": "裡面加了蔬菜,"
  },
  {
    "index": 40,
    "text": "and I have that.",
    "start": 102.124,
    "end": 103.344,
    "zh": "我今天吃的就是这个。",
    "zh_hant": "我今天吃的就是這個。"
  },
  {
    "index": 41,
    "text": "So, Beth, what do you usually have for lunch?",
    "start": 103.264,
    "end": 106.705,
    "zh": "那Beth,你平时午餐一般吃什么?",
    "zh_hant": "那Beth,你平時午餐一般吃什麼?"
  },
  {
    "index": 42,
    "text": "Is it usually leftovers or something else?",
    "start": 106.425,
    "end": 109.526,
    "zh": "是常吃剩菜,还是别的?",
    "zh_hant": "是常吃剩菜,還是別的?"
  },
  {
    "index": 43,
    "text": "It's usually leftovers when I come into work",
    "start": 109.906,
    "end": 113.847,
    "zh": "我上班的时候一般吃剩菜,",
    "zh_hant": "我上班的時候一般吃剩菜,"
  },
  {
    "index": 44,
    "text": "because it's easier,",
    "start": 113.968,
    "end": 116.608,
    "zh": "因为比较方便,",
    "zh_hant": "因為比較方便,"
  },
  {
    "index": 45,
    "text": "and then I don't need to buy lunch.",
    "start": 116.208,
    "end": 118.669,
    "zh": "这样我就不用买午餐了。",
    "zh_hant": "這樣我就不用買午餐了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 46,
    "text": "But if I go out and buy food,",
    "start": 119.009,
    "end": 122.11,
    "zh": "但如果我出去买吃的,",
    "zh_hant": "但如果我出去買吃的,"
  },
  {
    "index": 47,
    "text": "then I would usually go",
    "start": 122.07,
    "end": 124.571,
    "zh": "我通常会选",
    "zh_hant": "我通常會選"
  },
  {
    "index": 48,
    "text": "for something like sushi or ramen.",
    "start": 124.291,
    "end": 128.392,
    "zh": "寿司或者拉面之类的。",
    "zh_hant": "壽司或者拉麵之類的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 49,
    "text": "What about you?",
    "start": 128.793,
    "end": 129.853,
    "zh": "你呢?",
    "zh_hant": "你呢?"
  },
  {
    "index": 50,
    "text": "What do you usually have for lunch?",
    "start": 129.493,
    "end": 131.853,
    "zh": "你平时午餐吃什么?",
    "zh_hant": "你平時午餐吃什麼?"
  },
  {
    "index": 51,
    "text": "Yeah.",
    "start": 133.974,
    "end": 134.634,
    "zh": "嗯。",
    "zh_hant": "嗯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 52,
    "text": "Sometimes I have leftovers that I bring in.",
    "start": 134.234,
    "end": 137.235,
    "zh": "有时候我会带剩菜来吃。",
    "zh_hant": "有時候我會帶剩菜來吃。"
  },
  {
    "index": 53,
    "text": "Sometimes, I buy a sandwich, for example.",
    "start": 136.895,
    "end": 140.356,
    "zh": "有时候,我会买个三明治什么的。",
    "zh_hant": "有時候,我會買個三明治什麼的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 54,
    "text": "What's your favourite kind of sandwich?",
    "start": 140.897,
    "end": 143.277,
    "zh": "你最喜欢哪种三明治?",
    "zh_hant": "你最喜歡哪種三明治?"
  },
  {
    "index": 55,
    "text": "If I have a sandwich, if I buy a sandwich for lunch,",
    "start": 144.138,
    "end": 148.179,
    "zh": "如果我买三明治当午餐,",
    "zh_hant": "如果我買三明治當午餐,"
  },
  {
    "index": 56,
    "text": "I like to get things like smoked salmon.",
    "start": 147.779,
    "end": 151.44,
    "zh": "我喜欢吃烟熏三文鱼那种。",
    "zh_hant": "我喜歡吃煙燻三文魚那種。"
  },
  {
    "index": 57,
    "text": "Nice.",
    "start": 151.96,
    "end": 152.84,
    "zh": "不错。",
    "zh_hant": "不錯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 58,
    "text": "With pickles maybe, yeah.",
    "start": 152.701,
    "end": 155.741,
    "zh": "可能再加点腌菜,对。",
    "zh_hant": "可能再加點醃菜,對。"
  },
  {
    "index": 59,
    "text": "There's a really good baguette I like actually",
    "start": 156.022,
    "end": 158.622,
    "zh": "其实有一种法棍我特别喜欢,",
    "zh_hant": "其實有一種法棍我特別喜歡,"
  },
  {
    "index": 60,
    "text": "that has smoked salmon",
    "start": 158.222,
    "end": 161.163,
    "zh": "里面有烟熏三文鱼",
    "zh_hant": "裡面有煙燻三文魚"
  },
  {
    "index": 61,
    "text": "and egg mayonnaise in it.",
    "start": 161.263,
    "end": 164.304,
    "zh": "和蛋黄酱鸡蛋。",
    "zh_hant": "和蛋黃醬雞蛋。"
  },
  {
    "index": 62,
    "text": "Oh, it's so nice.",
    "start": 164.104,
    "end": 165.484,
    "zh": "哦,太好吃了。",
    "zh_hant": "哦,太好吃了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 63,
    "text": "Stop it.",
    "start": 165.365,
    "end": 166.305,
    "zh": "别说了。",
    "zh_hant": "別說了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 64,
    "text": "Sorry.",
    "start": 166.045,
    "end": 166.705,
    "zh": "抱歉。",
    "zh_hant": "抱歉。"
  },
  {
    "index": 65,
    "text": "I'm so hungry.",
    "start": 166.305,
    "end": 167.545,
    "zh": "我太饿了。",
    "zh_hant": "我太餓了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 66,
    "text": "Me too.",
    "start": 167.145,
    "end": 168.085,
    "zh": "我也是。",
    "zh_hant": "我也是。"
  },
  {
    "index": 67,
    "text": "Neil, do you ever skip lunch?",
    "start": 168.706,
    "end": 170.966,
    "zh": "Neil,你会不吃午餐吗?",
    "zh_hant": "Neil,你會不吃午餐嗎?"
  },
  {
    "index": 68,
    "text": "No way.",
    "start": 171.006,
    "end": 172.867,
    "zh": "绝对不会。",
    "zh_hant": "絕對不會。"
  },
  {
    "index": 69,
    "text": "I would be in a horrible mood",
    "start": 172.467,
    "end": 175.548,
    "zh": "如果不吃午餐,",
    "zh_hant": "如果不吃午餐,"
  },
  {
    "index": 70,
    "text": "if I skipped lunch.",
    "start": 175.568,
    "end": 177.208,
    "zh": "我心情会很糟糕。",
    "zh_hant": "我心情會很糟糕。"
  },
  {
    "index": 71,
    "text": "I don't understand",
    "start": 176.808,
    "end": 179.349,
    "zh": "我真不明白",
    "zh_hant": "我真不明白"
  },
  {
    "index": 72,
    "text": "how anyone can skip any meal.",
    "start": 178.949,
    "end": 182.01,
    "zh": "怎么会有人不吃某一顿饭。",
    "zh_hant": "怎麼會有人不吃某一頓飯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 73,
    "text": "I need to eat all my meals.",
    "start": 181.61,
    "end": 185.071,
    "zh": "我每顿饭都得吃。",
    "zh_hant": "我每頓飯都得吃。"
  },
  {
    "index": 74,
    "text": "Yeah.",
    "start": 185.311,
    "end": 185.971,
    "zh": "是啊。",
    "zh_hant": "是啊。"
  },
  {
    "index": 75,
    "text": "Otherwise, you get hangry.",
    "start": 186.131,
    "end": 187.852,
    "zh": "不然你会又饿又生气。",
    "zh_hant": "不然你會又餓又生氣。"
  },
  {
    "index": 76,
    "text": "Exactly.",
    "start": 187.812,
    "end": 188.712,
    "zh": "没错。",
    "zh_hant": "沒錯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 77,
    "text": "'Hangry' is hungry and angry.",
    "start": 188.312,
    "end": 191.613,
    "zh": "'hangry'就是又饿(hungry)又生气(angry)。",
    "zh_hant": "'hangry'就是又餓(hungry)又生氣(angry)。"
  },
  {
    "index": 78,
    "text": "I'm on",
    "start": 191.927,
    "end": 192.607,
    "zh": "我现在……",
    "zh_hant": "我現在……"
  },
  {
    "index": 79,
    "text": "the… I'm almost getting hangry now.",
    "start": 192.257,
    "end": 196.008,
    "zh": "我现在都快'hangry'了。",
    "zh_hant": "我現在都快'hangry'了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 80,
    "text": "What's your favourite meal?",
    "start": 196.775,
    "end": 198.675,
    "zh": "你最喜欢哪一餐?",
    "zh_hant": "你最喜歡哪一餐?"
  },
  {
    "index": 81,
    "text": "Is it lunch?",
    "start": 198.436,
    "end": 199.516,
    "zh": "是午餐吗?",
    "zh_hant": "是午餐嗎?"
  },
  {
    "index": 82,
    "text": "Breakfast?",
    "start": 199.596,
    "end": 200.576,
    "zh": "早餐?",
    "zh_hant": "早餐?"
  },
  {
    "index": 83,
    "text": "Dinner?",
    "start": 200.176,
    "end": 200.856,
    "zh": "晚餐?",
    "zh_hant": "晚餐?"
  },
  {
    "index": 84,
    "text": "I think",
    "start": 200.456,
    "end": 203.777,
    "zh": "我觉得",
    "zh_hant": "我覺得"
  },
  {
    "index": 85,
    "text": "the evening meal is probably my favourite",
    "start": 203.937,
    "end": 207.418,
    "zh": "晚餐大概是我最喜欢的,",
    "zh_hant": "晚餐大概是我最喜歡的,"
  },
  {
    "index": 86,
    "text": "because we sit at the table and chat",
    "start": 207.018,
    "end": 209.939,
    "zh": "因为我们会坐在餐桌旁聊天,",
    "zh_hant": "因為我們會坐在餐桌旁聊天,"
  },
  {
    "index": 87,
    "text": "and it's the biggest, nicest meal of the day",
    "start": 210.019,
    "end": 213.06,
    "zh": "而且这是一天中最丰盛、最美味的一餐,",
    "zh_hant": "而且這是一天中最豐盛、最美味的一餐,"
  },
  {
    "index": 88,
    "text": "and you don't really have to do anything after so you can relax.",
    "start": 213.24,
    "end": 217.662,
    "zh": "吃完之后也不用再做什么事,可以放松一下。",
    "zh_hant": "吃完之後也不用再做什麼事,可以放鬆一下。"
  },
  {
    "index": 89,
    "text": "Yeah that's good.",
    "start": 218.262,
    "end": 219.482,
    "zh": "嗯,这样挺好的。",
    "zh_hant": "嗯,這樣挺好的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 90,
    "text": "I really like brunch",
    "start": 219.082,
    "end": 221.403,
    "zh": "我特别喜欢brunch(早午餐),",
    "zh_hant": "我特別喜歡brunch(早午餐),"
  },
  {
    "index": 91,
    "text": "which is that sort of in between breakfast and lunch,",
    "start": 221.203,
    "end": 224.984,
    "zh": "就是介于早餐和午餐之间的那种,",
    "zh_hant": "就是介於早餐和午餐之間的那種,"
  },
  {
    "index": 92,
    "text": "maybe 10:00.",
    "start": 224.584,
    "end": 226.925,
    "zh": "大概十点左右。",
    "zh_hant": "大概十點左右。"
  },
  {
    "index": 93,
    "text": "And I might have eggs",
    "start": 226.525,
    "end": 229.045,
    "zh": "我可能会吃鸡蛋、",
    "zh_hant": "我可能會吃雞蛋、"
  },
  {
    "index": 94,
    "text": "and bacon and hash browns and avocado,",
    "start": 228.645,
    "end": 232.347,
    "zh": "培根、土豆煎饼和牛油果,",
    "zh_hant": "培根、土豆煎餅和牛油果,"
  },
  {
    "index": 95,
    "text": "a big meal full of lots of good food,",
    "start": 231.947,
    "end": 235.808,
    "zh": "一顿丰盛美味的大餐,",
    "zh_hant": "一頓豐盛美味的大餐,"
  },
  {
    "index": 96,
    "text": "like a brunch.",
    "start": 235.768,
    "end": 236.868,
    "zh": "就像brunch那样。",
    "zh_hant": "就像brunch那樣。"
  },
  {
    "index": 97,
    "text": "Do you ever have a working lunch ?",
    "start": 237.408,
    "end": 240.859,
    "zh": "你有过'working lunch'(工作午餐)吗?",
    "zh_hant": "你有過'working lunch'(工作午餐)嗎?"
  },
  {
    "index": 98,
    "text": "I do occasionally if",
    "start": 240.459,
    "end": 243.71,
    "zh": "偶尔会有,如果",
    "zh_hant": "偶爾會有,如果"
  },
  {
    "index": 99,
    "text": "I'm working from home",
    "start": 243.31,
    "end": 245.091,
    "zh": "我是在家办公,",
    "zh_hant": "我是在家辦公,"
  },
  {
    "index": 100,
    "text": "because I can carry",
    "start": 246.611,
    "end": 249.812,
    "zh": "因为这样我可以边工作",
    "zh_hant": "因為這樣我可以邊工作"
  },
  {
    "index": 101,
    "text": "on working and eat quickly.",
    "start": 249.412,
    "end": 251.213,
    "zh": "边快速吃饭。",
    "zh_hant": "邊快速吃飯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 102,
    "text": "And then in my actual lunch break,",
    "start": 250.813,
    "end": 253.053,
    "zh": "然后到真正的午休时间,",
    "zh_hant": "然後到真正的午休時間,"
  },
  {
    "index": 103,
    "text": "I might have a nice long walk or something like that,",
    "start": 252.653,
    "end": 256.575,
    "zh": "我可能会去美美地散个步之类的,",
    "zh_hant": "我可能會去美美地散個步之類的,"
  },
  {
    "index": 104,
    "text": "but when I'm in the office, I don't want to eat at my desk.",
    "start": 256.895,
    "end": 260.236,
    "zh": "但如果在办公室,我就不想在办公桌前吃饭。",
    "zh_hant": "但如果在辦公室,我就不想在辦公桌前吃飯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 105,
    "text": "No. Me neither.",
    "start": 260.136,
    "end": 261.476,
    "zh": "不会。我也不喜欢。",
    "zh_hant": "不會。我也不喜歡。"
  },
  {
    "index": 106,
    "text": "I don't really like working lunches .",
    "start": 261.076,
    "end": 264.697,
    "zh": "我不太喜欢工作午餐。",
    "zh_hant": "我不太喜歡工作午餐。"
  },
  {
    "index": 107,
    "text": "I would rather eat my lunch without working.",
    "start": 264.297,
    "end": 267.958,
    "zh": "我宁愿好好吃午饭,不边工作。",
    "zh_hant": "我寧願好好吃午飯,不邊工作。"
  },
  {
    "index": 108,
    "text": "Yeah, I'd prefer the same, really.",
    "start": 268.839,
    "end": 271.7,
    "zh": "嗯,我也更喜欢那样。",
    "zh_hant": "嗯,我也更喜歡那樣。"
  },
  {
    "index": 109,
    "text": "We heard 'working lunch',",
    "start": 281.744,
    "end": 291.747,
    "zh": "我们学到了'working lunch',",
    "zh_hant": "我們學到了'working lunch',"
  },
  {
    "index": 110,
    "text": "which is when you eat your lunch while you're working.",
    "start": 291.427,
    "end": 294.628,
    "zh": "就是指一边工作一边吃午饭。",
    "zh_hant": "就是指一邊工作一邊吃午飯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 111,
    "text": "We also had 'leftovers', which is when you don't finish a meal,",
    "start": 295.408,
    "end": 299.769,
    "zh": "我们还学到了'leftovers',指没吃完的饭菜,",
    "zh_hant": "我們還學到了'leftovers',指沒吃完的飯菜,"
  },
  {
    "index": 112,
    "text": "so you have more of it at a different time, like the next day.",
    "start": 299.569,
    "end": 303.351,
    "zh": "留到之后,比如第二天再吃。",
    "zh_hant": "留到之後,比如第二天再吃。"
  },
  {
    "index": 113,
    "text": "And we talked about which meals and food we prefer.",
    "start": 303.671,
    "end": 307.432,
    "zh": "我们还聊了各自更喜欢哪些餐和食物。",
    "zh_hant": "我們還聊了各自更喜歡哪些餐和食物。"
  },
  {
    "index": 114,
    "text": "If you prefer something, you like it better than something else.",
    "start": 307.292,
    "end": 311.153,
    "zh": "如果你'prefer'某样东西,就是说你更喜欢它,而不是别的。",
    "zh_hant": "如果你'prefer'某樣東西,就是說你更喜歡它,而不是別的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 115,
    "text": "Yes.",
    "start": 311.193,
    "end": 311.953,
    "zh": "对。",
    "zh_hant": "對。"
  },
  {
    "index": 116,
    "text": "And another phrase we can use to say this is 'would rather'.",
    "start": 311.693,
    "end": 315.975,
    "zh": "另外一个表达同样意思的说法是'would rather'。",
    "zh_hant": "另外一個表達同樣意思的說法是'would rather'。"
  },
  {
    "index": 117,
    "text": "For example, I 'd rather have sushi",
    "start": 315.895,
    "end": 318.856,
    "zh": "比如,我'宁愿'吃寿司,",
    "zh_hant": "比如,我'寧願'吃壽司,"
  },
  {
    "index": 118,
    "text": "than a sandwich for lunch.",
    "start": 318.636,
    "end": 320.476,
    "zh": "也不想吃三明治当午餐。",
    "zh_hant": "也不想吃三明治當午餐。"
  },
  {
    "index": 119,
    "text": "That's it for this episode of Real Easy English.",
    "start": 320.676,
    "end": 323.677,
    "zh": "这就是本期《Real Easy English》的全部内容。",
    "zh_hant": "這就是本期《Real Easy English》的全部內容。"
  },
  {
    "index": 120,
    "text": "Test what you've learned with a worksheet on our website,",
    "start": 323.297,
    "end": 326.378,
    "zh": "去我们网站上的练习题,测试一下你学到的内容吧,",
    "zh_hant": "去我們網站上的練習題,測試一下你學到的內容吧,"
  },
  {
    "index": 121,
    "text": "bbclearningenglish.com.",
    "start": 326.078,
    "end": 328.32,
    "zh": "网址是bbclearningenglish.com。",
    "zh_hant": "網址是bbclearningenglish.com。"
  },
  {
    "index": 122,
    "text": "And make sure you join us",
    "start": 328.36,
    "end": 330.282,
    "zh": "一定要继续关注我们,",
    "zh_hant": "一定要繼續關注我們,"
  },
  {
    "index": 123,
    "text": "again for another easy English conversation.",
    "start": 329.922,
    "end": 333.645,
    "zh": "收听下一期简单英语对话。",
    "zh_hant": "收聽下一期簡單英語對話。"
  },
  {
    "index": 124,
    "text": "We'll be back next week.",
    "start": 333.565,
    "end": 335.146,
    "zh": "我们下周再见。",
    "zh_hant": "我們下週再見。"
  },
  {
    "index": 125,
    "text": "See you soon.",
    "start": 334.947,
    "end": 335.927,
    "zh": "再见。",
    "zh_hant": "再見。"
  },
  {
    "index": 126,
    "text": "Goodbye.",
    "start": 336.028,
    "end": 336.868,
    "zh": "拜拜。",
    "zh_hant": "拜拜。"
  }
]
